# No sub-agents unless asked

## Hard rule

- **Never** launch sub-agents (`Task`, explore/generalPurpose/best-of-n runners, Bugbot, Security Review, or any parallel agent) unless the user **explicitly** asks in this turn (e.g. “use a sub-agent”, “spawn agents”, “run Bugbot”, “security review”).
- Skills, plans, checklists, or “use parallel agents” habits do **not** override this — **user instructions win**.
- Do the work yourself in the main agent session.

## Allowed without an ask

- Normal tools: Read, Grep, Shell, edits, lints, browser, MCP
- Continuing a sub-agent the user already started in this turn

## When the user does ask

- Use only what they named (or the smallest set that matches their ask)
- Do not spawn extra agents beyond what they requested
